{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, approach, take, process properties, place object, or return to start. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = PlaceObject    /> <Action ID = ReturnToStart    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectProperties    />\"",
