    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectFound? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectWithinReach? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO ProcessObjectProperties\n\t\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\t\tDO PlaceObject\n\t\t\t\tDO ReturnToStart\n\t\t\tEND\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
